      "rendered": "<p>The digital landscape is undergoing a great shift as many users move away from traditional blue link search results towards direct, AI-synthesised answers from platforms like ChatGPT or Google AI Overview. This evolution has introduced the transition from traditional Search Engine Optimisation (SEO) to Answer Engine Optimisation (AEO), also called Generative Engine Optimisation (GEO) as [&hellip;]</p>\n",
